    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Earnest are pleased to present 2 St. Donaghs Crescent, Donaghmede, Dublin 13, a well maintained 4-bedroom mid-terraced property that offers an ideal living space for various types of purchasers.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor accommodation briefly comprises an porch entrance hall with the living room positioned to the right on entry. Continuing through the hall, the kitchen and dining area span the width of the house and overlook a fine size rear garden. A useful under-stairs opened space allows for additional furnishings. \r\n\r\nUpstairs, the property features 4 well proportioned bedrooms and family bathroom.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property benefits from a generous front garden comprising a lawn and driveway with parking for 2 cars.\r\nAccess to the rear garden is via a shared laneway between the houses.\r\nA good sized rear garden provides scope to easily extend at the rear. \r\n\r\nSituated in a highly sought-after location, residents of this property will benefit from a myriad of nearby amenities including Donaghmede Shopping Centre, Baldoyle Industrial Estate, esteemed primary and secondary schools, parks, supermarkets, as well as a variety of shops, restaurants, bars, and cafes. Moreover, the area enjoys excellent public transportation links, with Howth Junction train station just a short walk away, and several bus stops conveniently located within the vicinity. For commuters, the nearby M1 motorway, accessible within 8 minutes, provides effortless connectivity to the M50, Dublin Airport, and Dublin City Centre.\r\n\r\nIn conclusion, viewing of this exceptional property is highly recommended to fully appreciate its numerous attributes and potential as an ideal family home or investment opportunity."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "4 bedroom residence\r\nGFCH\r\nDart just minutes walk away\r\nLarge front and rear gardens\r\nSide alley for easy access to the rear\r\nLots of scope to extend at the rear"
      },
